### Загрузить превью для оффера
POST http://localhost:4000/offers/69e0be2e8681d09d801a5765/preview HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFuc0BvdmVybG9vay5uZXQiLCJuYW1lIjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc4MDIxNzM5OCwiZXhwIjoxNzgwMzkwMTk4fQ.BxYGHcOZip3K7VjsD215r-kggOF2tJwbcli2UEMbA0w
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryPreview

------WebKitFormBoundaryPreview
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="preview"; filename="preview.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../../static/preview.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryPreview--

